        "pdf_visual_context_group",
        "progress_or_change_language",
        "specific_business_event"
      ],
      "raw_text": "在3D NAND 芯片制造环节，公司的等离子体刻蚀设备已应用于200 层以上的量产，同时公司根据存储器件客户的需求正在开发极高深宽比的刻蚀设备和工艺；",
      "raw_text_sha256": "6dab0a45ff57801f1757a627f828792f9844a83934dd881636062a342f2906ae"
    },
    {
      "category": "positioning",
      "cost": 6,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:28/paragraph:20",
        "loc:v1/page:28/paragraph:21",
        "loc:v1/page:28/paragraph:22",
        "loc:v1/page:28/paragraph:23",
        "loc:v1/page:28/paragraph:24",
        "loc:v1/page:28/paragraph:25"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "pdf_visual_context_group",
        "specific_emerging_business_positioning"
      ],
      "raw_text": "第三节\n管理层讨论与分析一、报告期内公司所从事的主要业务、经营模式、行业情况说明(一) 主要业务、主要产品或服务情况报告期内，公司主要从事高端半导体设备及泛半导体设备的研发、生产和销售。公司瞄准世界科技前沿，基于在半导体设备制造产业多年积累的专业技术，涉足半导体集成电路制造、先进",
      "raw_text_sha256": "0f693f21d4b0a9350d3a9e6b90657b945adb1b53b882d6ad7dad8d0d91b7c683"
    },
    {
      "category": "critical_risk",
      "cost": 3,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:62/paragraph:27",
        "loc:v1/page:62/paragraph:28",
        "loc:v1/page:62/paragraph:29"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_group_context",
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "business_risk_or_constraint",
        "operating_qualification",
        "pdf_visual_context_group",
        "progress_or_change_language",
        "specific_operating_constraint"
      ],
      "raw_text": "3、上游供应链产能紧张的风险近年来，随着全球经济和日常生活的加速数字化转型，半导体行业保持高景气周期，半导体器件供应链持续紧张。",
      "raw_text_sha256": "1a0dd7784e39f82440e55af25e2a37a6c577ff73719dd74c2f3ddcc1e21ef6cc"
    },
    {
      "category": "operating_mechanism",
      "cost": 2,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:31/paragraph:39",
        "loc:v1/page:31/paragraph:40"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_group_context",
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "current_industry_context",
        "operating_mechanism",
        "operating_qualification",
        "pdf_visual_context_group",
        "progress_or_change_language"
      ],
      "raw_text": "因此，面向氮化镓功率器件的外延设备的需求具有很大的增长空间。",
      "raw_text_sha256": "6ed9ba8563fb854c4f1a419944ec560a832b7fae29b444c66141d098c1c5a3ad"
    },
    {
      "category": "critical_risk",
      "cost": 3,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:62/paragraph:30",
        "loc:v1/page:62/paragraph:31",
        "loc:v1/page:62/paragraph:32"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_group_context",
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "business_risk_or_constraint",
        "operating_mechanism",
        "operating_qualification",
        "pdf_visual_context_group",
        "specific_operating_constraint"
      ],
      "raw_text": "公司科学管理供应厂商，对关键零部件供应商采取多厂商策略保障零部件及时供应。若未来上游供应链产能紧张形势延续，将对公司设备交期产生影响。",
      "raw_text_sha256": "d42cf02b23b3d6a22774a3f32e2a65c7c8ead9a4e5b7786e29418c5ef69e8a46"
    },
    {
      "category": "corporate_development",
      "cost": 2,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:40/paragraph:12",
        "loc:v1/page:40/paragraph:13"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "corporate_development",
        "pdf_visual_context_group",
        "project_plan_or_status"
      ],
      "raw_text": "同时，公司拟通过发行股份及支付现金购买资产并募集配套资金的方式购买杭州众硅电子科技有限公司控股权实现从“干法”向“干法+湿法”整体解决方案的关键跨越。",
      "raw_text_sha256": "9854adbe80cf1a5fed7e543055e725ca24be291a33eb431934a5e6b812bd62ad"
    },
    {
      "category": "operating_status",
      "cost": 3,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:75/paragraph:13",
        "loc:v1/page:75/paragraph:14",
        "loc:v1/page:75/paragraph:15"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_group_context",
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "current_industry_context",
        "operating_qualification",
        "pdf_visual_context_group",
        "progress_or_change_language",
        "quantified_operating_status"
      ],
      "raw_text": "其中，人工智能（AI）相关半导体（包括处理器、高带宽内存HBM 及网络组件）成为核心增长引擎，贡献了近三分之一的销售额，且预计到2026 年AI 基础设施支出将突破1.3 万亿美元。",
      "raw_text_sha256": "1e6f0504fe3abc957d24218576ff40ed72344da4695a7fb0dee7d962a656a877"
    },
    {
      "category": "risk",
      "cost": 3,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:31/paragraph:7",
        "loc:v1/page:31/paragraph:8",
        "loc:v1/page:31/paragraph:9"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_group_context",
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "business_risk_or_constraint",
        "operating_mechanism",
        "operating_qualification",
        "progress_or_change_language"
      ],
      "raw_text": "由于目前先进工艺芯片加工使用的光刻机受到波长限制，14 纳米及以下的逻辑器件微观结构的加工多通过等离子体刻蚀和薄膜沉积的工艺组合——多重模板工艺来实现，使得刻蚀等相关设备的加工步骤增多。",
      "raw_text_sha256": "6cacd28548f861eceeb23fe1ede574265d2ab8717642ac58b618e843161a045e"
    },
    {
      "category": "quantified_industry",
      "cost": 3,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:75/paragraph:20",
        "loc:v1/page:75/paragraph:21",
        "loc:v1/page:75/paragraph:22"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_group_context",
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "current_industry_context",
        "operating_qualification",
        "pdf_visual_context_group",
        "quantified_industry_outlook"
      ],
      "raw_text": "半导体设备位于半导体产业链的上游，其市场规模随着下游半导体技术发展和市场需求而波动，据国际半导体产业协会（SEMI）预测，全球半导体制造装备销售额今年将达1330 亿美元，同比增加13.7%；",
      "raw_text_sha256": "6fffeeeb23a03cfcdd22d2647b9412a79d0b109b27fc945b01713009018094b0"
    },
    {
      "category": "industry",
      "cost": 3,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:75/paragraph:30",
        "loc:v1/page:75/paragraph:31",
        "loc:v1/page:75/paragraph:32"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_group_context",
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "current_industry_context",
        "operating_qualification",
        "pdf_visual_context_group",
        "progress_or_change_language"
      ],
      "raw_text": "作为全球最大的半导体消费市场，市场需求带动全球产能中心逐步向中国大陆转移，持续的产能转移带动了市场规模和技术水平的提高，也为设备行业的发展提供了机遇。",
      "raw_text_sha256": "f2cd1444fcc29cad938863058ba1291cf662b2e3d82f563382435944ebd118c3"
    },
    {
      "category": "other",
      "cost": 2,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:102/paragraph:23",
        "loc:v1/page:102/paragraph:24"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_group_context",
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "business_structure",
        "operating_qualification",
        "progress_or_change_language"
      ],
      "raw_text": "公司严格履行信息披露义务，通过公告、投资者交流会、业绩说明会等多渠道，做到信息披露的真实、准确、及时、完整，使得股东和债权人平等的获取信息。",
      "raw_text_sha256": "ad58748223d7a6d174497031235bccf0c4ff6a11be275a5f831aa59934799a2f"
    },
    {
      "category": "risk",
      "cost": 3,
      "locators": [
        "loc:v1/page:39/paragraph:8",
        "loc:v1/page:39/paragraph:9",
        "loc:v1/page:39/paragraph:10"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "business_group_context",
        "business_narrative_signal",
        "business_risk_or_constraint",
        "operating_qualification"
      ],
      "raw_text": "光刻机由于波长的限制，先进的微观结构要靠等离子体刻蚀和薄膜的组合“二重模板”和“四重模板”工艺技术来加工，刻蚀机和薄膜设备的重要性不断提高，这给主要提供等离子体刻蚀设备和薄膜设备的中微公司带来了高速成长机会。",
      "raw_text_sha256": "9cb2bd075e77e9ab65f4799e11abaec8895c38ca29e6e0fa71abbc2f3251a326"
    }
  ],
